"    增加大企业会计科目表\n"
"\n"
"We added the option to print a voucher which will also\n"
"print the amount in words (special Chinese characters for numbers)\n"
"correctly when the cn2an library is installed. (e.g. with pip3 install "
"cn2an)\n"
